Copyright (c) 2026 Mohammad Bagher Ehtemam. All rights reserved.

Every file under fixtures/en-halloween-decorating/ EXCEPT the two files named under
"Third party" below. These are the real assets of an already-published short from the
maintainer's own language channel: four source stills, eleven voice-over recordings, the
channel logo, the finished MP4, four derived Ken Burns clips, two extracted frames, the
subtitle files, and the JSON that composes them.

They are committed so that this repository's tests and research can be judged against
real input instead of plausible invented input, and that is the only use granted:

    Permission is granted to use these files ONLY to build, test, benchmark and study
    this repository -- including in a fork of it, and including running the repository's
    test suite and research harnesses. Any other use, and in particular any commercial
    use, any redistribution apart from this repository, any use of the channel's logo,
    photography or recorded voice in another work, and any use to train a generative
    model, requires the copyright holder's written permission.

fixtures/video-decode/ holds no media of its own -- its source is the published MP4
above, reached by a relative path -- but anything rendered from it is derived from that
MP4 and carries the same terms.

Renders of this media are derivatives of it and carry the same terms wherever they live
in the tree. ../LICENSE-MEDIA.md lists them; they are the golden frames under
crates/montagent-core/tests/golden/ and the committed frames of four prototypes under
docs/research/prototypes/.


